ics</strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Local Network</strong>:=
 1-5ms</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Same City</strong>: 10-=
20ms</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cross-country</strong>:=
 50-100ms</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>International</strong>:=
 100-300ms</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Satellite</strong>: 500=
-600ms</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Memory Overhead</strong>=
:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>TCP Control Block</stro=
ng>: ~2KB per connection</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Send Buffer</strong>: 1=
6KB-64KB default</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Receive Buffer</strong>=
: 16KB-64KB default</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Connection Pool</strong=
>: Browser maintains ~6 connections per domain</li>
</ul>
