<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Why Layout is Expensive<=
/strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Recursive Calculation</=
strong>: Parent size affects children, children content affects parent</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Complex Algorithms</str=
ong>: Flexbox, Grid, Table layouts have sophisticated calculation rules</li=
>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cascade Effects</strong=
>: Changing one element can affect many others</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Multiple Passes</strong=
>: Some layouts require multiple calculation rounds</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Layout Types</strong>:</=
