<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Normal Flow</strong>: B=
lock v=C3=A0 inline layout</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Flexbox</strong>: One-d=
imensional flexible layout</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Grid</strong>: Two-dime=
nsional grid layout</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Table</strong>: Table c=
ell layout</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Positioned</strong>: Ab=
solute/fixed positioning</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Float</strong>: Legacy =
floating layout</li>
</ul>
