<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=8C=B1 Ngu=
=E1=BB=93n G=E1=BB=91c &amp; Motivation</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Problem Statement</stron=
g>: Layout phase calculated WHERE elements should be positioned, nh=C6=B0ng=
 ch=C6=B0a determined HOW they should look visually. Paint phase converts r=
ender objects th=C3=A0nh actual pixels v=E1=BB=9Bi colors, borders, shadows=
, backgrounds, etc.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Why Paint is Complex</st=
