<h2 class=3D"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5">=F0=9F=94=84 COM=
POSITE - T=E1=BB=95ng H=E1=BB=A3p C=C3=A1c Layers</h2>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=8C=B1 Ngu=
=E1=BB=93n G=E1=BB=91c &amp; Motivation</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Problem Statement</stron=
g>: Paint phase creates visual content for each layer, nh=C6=B0ng multiple =
layers c=E1=BA=A7n =C4=91=C6=B0=E1=BB=A3c combined th=C3=A0nh final image. =
Composite phase handles layer blending, transformations, v=C3=A0 final pixe=
l output.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Why Composite is Critica=
l</strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Hardware Acceleration</=
strong>: GPU can composite layers much faster than CPU</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Smooth Animations</stro=
ng>: Transform v=C3=A0 opacity changes ch=E1=BB=89 require compositing</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Layer Management</stron=
g>: Proper layer strategy enables 60fps performance</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Memory Optimization</st=
rong>: Minimize GPU memory usage cho mobile devices</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>What Triggers Layer Crea=
