<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>DNS Resolution</strong>=
 - How domain names become IP addresses</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>TCP Three-way Handshake=
</strong> - Establishing reliable connections</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>HTTP Request Constructi=
