<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">HTML Parser =E2=86=92 DOM Tree<=
/li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">CSS Parser =E2=86=92 CSSOM Tree=
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Render Tree Construction</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Layout (Reflow) - calculating p=
ositions/sizes</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Paint - converting to pixels</l=
i>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Composite - combining layers</l=
i>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">For each section, I provided:</p=
