<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Optimization Strategies=
</strong> - Practical performance tips</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">I maintained the Principal Engin=
eer perspective throughout, showing both deep technical knowledge and pract=
ical production experience. The analysis included actual code examples from=
 browser engines (Chromium), optimization strategies used at major tech com=
panies, and comprehensive performance monitoring approaches.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">The conclusion tied everything t=
ogether with practical takeaways and advanced topics for continued learning=
, emphasizing the systems thinking required at a Principal Engineer level.<=
/p>
